    "body": "## Summary\n\nFinal commit of ADR-042. Marks the ADR as Implemented with the PNG-verified visible delta.\n\n**Confirmed**: title \"HTML\" underline appears in AFTER screenshot, absent in BEFORE.\n\n## The prediction chain finally resolves\n\n| ADR | Claim | Resolution |\n|---|---|---|\n| **ADR-040** | h1 border shorthand would underline the title | Wrong mechanism (h1 border overridden); prediction eventually visually true via different path |\n| **ADR-041** | Pseudo synthesis needed for `.vector-page-titlebar::after` | Correctly identified actual mechanism; parse + cascade shipped, visible synthesis deferred |\n| **ADR-042** | Absolute positioning + pseudo synthesis → underline | Delivered — PNG-verified |\n\n**Five ADRs' worth of prediction chain (040 → 041 → 042) is now fully resolved.**\n\n## Docs updated\n\n- ADR-042 → Implemented with full Implementation section\n- ADR-033: Post-ADR-042 note (relative + absolute superseded; sticky remains deferred)\n- ADR-041: Post-ADR-042 note (deferred visible delta delivered)\n- README row 042 updated\n- CHANGELOG entry\n\n## Test count (unchanged by this commit)\n\n- 539 cases / 2064 assertions all pass\n- Documentation only; no code changes\n\nRefs #209",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-28T07:27:31Z",
